{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17717","headline":"送定法师归蜀法师即红楼院供奉广宣上人兄弟 · 杨巨源","name":"送定法师归蜀法师即红楼院供奉广宣上人兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤城初日照红楼，禁寺公卿识惠休。\n诗引棣华沾一雨，经分贝叶向双流。\n孤猿学定前山夕，远鴈伤离几地秋。\n空性碧云无处所，约公曾许剡溪游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}